Lantern Mothkeeper — final completion (public game verified)

**Summary:** Pure HTML/CSS/JS arcade, single `index.html` (no external assets). Lantern follows arrow/WASD + mouse/touch/pointer with velocity clamp and glow pulse (`lantern.glow+70` attraction). Golden moths are drawn into the glow, slowed inside inner radius and collected for +10 (+combo +2 per 3). Storm sparks spawn faster as time runs (0.95s → 0.4s), hit = -7, shake, flash, stun 0.22s. 60s timer with warning timeBar, score/best HUD, particle trails, start/pause/game-over overlays, restart via R/Space/buttons + tap-anywhere on shell (Flappy/Suika instant-replay fix). Responsive `800x560` canvas, mobile touch, starfield vignette.

